data: {"id": "265643d404d244ba-thinking-parallel_evidence-2063", "run_id": "265643d404d244ba", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 本轮采集事实、冲突与缺口\n\n### 已确认事实（支持）\n\n1. **Pending 状态持续存在**：PromQL 时序数据（过去 30 分钟，5 个数据点）确认 `kube_pod_status_phase` 中 `Pending=1.0`，其他状态均为 0，**无状态跳变**。\n\n2. **Pending 的直接原因**：`kubectl_describe` 和 YAML 均明确显示：\n   - `nodeSelector: {\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"true\"}`\n   - 事件日志：`FailedScheduling`，原因 `3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`\n   - 集群共 3 个节点，**全部不匹配**该 nodeSelector（即所有节点都没有 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 标签）\n\n3. **Pod 未调度到任何节点**：`nodeName: <none>`，容器未启动，**无日志输出**（kubectl_logs 返回空）。\n\n4.", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788409478135, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

