条件，导致调度器拒绝调度。\n\n该结论由以下证据支撑：\n- K8s 事件 `FailedScheduling` 明确指出调度失败原因是节点不匹配 Pod 的亲和性/选择器 (证据 1)。\n- K8s 状态持续显示 `Unschedulable` 和 `Pending` (证据 2、3)。\n- 资源请求值极小，排除了资源不足的可能 (证据 4)。\n- 指标数据确认 Pod 长期处于 Pending 状态 (证据 5、6)。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 24.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 59.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh: 59.2s (Evidence 51.2s, RCA 7.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 95.413, "metrics": {"run_id": "265643d404d244ba", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 95.41970825195312, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "50%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties